  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 12 ÷ 3 - 2 + 5 × 4 = 23.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 3 and 4\n\nGiven: 12 ÷ 3 - 2 + 5 × 4 = 23.\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**12 ÷ 4**__ - 2 + 5 × 3 = 23\n\n⇒ 3 - 2 + __**5 × 3**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**3**__ - 2 __**+ 15**__ = 23\n\n⇒ 18 - 2 = 23\n\n⇒ 16 ≠ 23\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) 3 and 2**\n\nGiven: 12 ÷ 3 - 2 + 5 × 4 = 23\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**12 ÷ 2**__ - 3 + 5 × 4 = 23\n\n⇒ 6 - 3 + __**5 × 4**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**6**__ - 3 __**+ 20**__ = 23\n\n⇒ 26 - 3 = 23\n\n⇒ **23 = 23**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) 3 and 5\n\nGiven: 12 ÷ 3 - 2 + 5 × 4 = 23\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**12 ÷ 5**__ - 2 + 3 × 4 = 23\n\n⇒ 2.4 - 2 + __**3**____** × 4**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**2.4**__ - 2 __**+ 12**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**14.4 - 2**__ = 23\n\n⇒ 12.2 ≠ 23\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 4 and 5\n\nGiven: 12 ÷ 3 - 2 + 5 × 4 = 23\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**12 ÷ 3**__ - 2 + 4 × 5 = 23\n\n⇒ 4 - 2 + __**4**____** × 5**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**4**__ - 2 __**+ 20**__ = 23\n\n⇒ 24 - 2 = 23\n\n⇒ 22 ≠ 23\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
